6. Suggested closing summary

You need a strong close for this audience.

Recommended close

“The main message I want to leave is that this workstream is not about creating another isolated platform. It is about defining the enterprise capability model for unstructured data and AI.

That matters because unstructured content is already becoming a critical input into AI use cases across the bank. Without a shared architecture and shared capability model, we will continue to see fragmented builds, inconsistent controls, duplicated cost, and slower scaling.

The value of this workstream is that it gives the bank a clearer, more reusable, and more governable path for unstructured AI — and VectorDBaaS is one example of how that architecture can be productised into a shared service where the need is strong enough.”

